    1x Assuming that the statements are complete, expecting '}'.
       <^_>these statements
       <_>This '{' opens the enclosing construct.
    1x Expecting ')' or an operator.
       <_>This '(' opens the enclosing construct.
    1x Expecting ')', ';', or an operator.
    1x Expecting ';' or an operator.
